namespace Pscf {

/*! \page user_param_domain_page Parameter File - Domain Block

\ref user_param_mixture_page  (Prev) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;
\ref user_command_page        (Next)
<BR>

Every PSCF parameter file contains a block labelled "Domain" that
appears after the %Mixture and %Interaction Blocks. This block contains 
information about the spatial domain within which a SCFT or PS-FTS 
calculation will be performed.  Different formats for the Domain block
are required by pscf_r1d and pscf_rp, as described in the two pages
linked below:

<ol>
<li> \subpage user_param_domain_1d_page  </li>
<li> \subpage user_param_domain_pc_page  </li>
</ol>

<BR>
\ref user_param_mixture_page  (Prev) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;
\ref user_param_page          (Up)   &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;
\ref user_command_page        (Next)

*/

}
